{
  "params": {
    "query": "string",
    "max_results": 50,
    "page_number": 1
  }
}

Output:
{
  "data": {
    "foods": [ ... ],
    "pagination": {
      "total_results": 1234,
      "page": 1,
      "has_more": true
    }
  }
}

Requirements:
- Full-text search support
- Brand filtering
- Pagination support
- < 300ms cold start (read-heavy)
- Result caching

